    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilagano lyamwa Mulungu ku'mwa Abulamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyav'i'taga itungo, muhayo gwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu gwamwizi'i'laga Abulamu ki'ti' ndoti ati', “Abulamu! Ku'du' wogohe, ene ni' lu'hi'gi' lwako. Na wu'syokeziwa wako wu'lav'e wu'hanya muno.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Abulamu wayombaga, “Gu'ku' Mulungu ev'e Katema, u'ku'mpa ki' u'lu' ene nikalile ni' wu'du'hu' mwana, sumbwa mwenu'yu' Eliezeli, Mudamasiko, hu' mwene wa ku'nsaala? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lingaga! U'kandosizye ku'mpa mwana, sumbwa mukumba u'yo wav'yali'lilwe mu lu'go lwanne hu' mwene aku'v'a musaali'ki wanne!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho muhayo gwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu gwamwizi'i'laga ati', “Muntu' mwenu'yu' akasye aku'saale sumbwa mwana wa kwiv'yali'la ev'e mweni'ki'li' hu' mwene alaku'saale” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamufumyaga Abulamu ha ibala na wamuwi'laga, “Langami'la ku' ilunde na u'zisolozye nsonda u'lu' u'ku'kowola ku'zisolozya.” Wamuwi'laga, “I'vi Hu' vyene wu'lav'e wingi wa wu'v'yalwa wako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Abulamu wamusani'zyaga Gu'ku' Mulungu, nawe Mulungu wamuv'azi'zyaga Abulamu ku'v'a ali' wa lole.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho wamuwi'laga, “Ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo naku'fumizye ku' kaya ya Ulu ya V'akalidayo, ki'gele nku'pe nsi' yeni'yi' yi'v'e isaalo lyako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Abulamu wawu'zyaga, “Gu'ku' Mulungu ev'e Katema, nku'manya vihe ati' nku'yi'saala nsi' yeni'yi'?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga, “Ndetele ndogosa ya ng'ombe, ng'ondi na mbu'li nki'ma, ki'la ki'mo ki'v'e cha myaka idatu', haki'mo na ipu'u'la na ikune lya nkunda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abulamu wamuletelaga vyose, wayi'tandu'laga ki'la ndimu mav'ale av'i'li', wagatu'u'laga ki'la li'mo li'lole ku' liye, sumbwa tu'noni twene akatu'tandu'lile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga manoni malyanyama aho gademaga ha igu'lya na malimbo ki'gele galye, Abulamu wagapeezyaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha itungo lya ku'loka lyu'v'a, tu'lo tu'timbu twamuv'i'ti'laga Abulamu, kasinaga giti nhanya ya kogohya yamukumbaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Yi'li'ku'dima u'manye ku'v'a wu'v'yalwa wako v'alikale ku' nsi' ya wu'geni ki'ti' v'ageni v'izi'li'zi, nav'o v'alav'e v'asese na v'alatukiwe kwenu'ko ku' itungo lya myaka magana ane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi nsi' yeni'yo i'yo v'alayi'tu'mami'le ki'ti' v'asese, ndayi'pe lu'duko, nav'o v'alafume na nsawo nyingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumbwa ev'e u'ku'v'a na wikalo wu'lihu, u'lafwe na ku'hola, na u'lazyi'kwe visoga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu v'av'yalwa v'ako, wu'v'yalwa wa wu'ne",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Wu'v'yalwa wa wu'ne ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo ki'ti' myaka magana ane.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " hu' wene wu'lasu'v'e henanha, ku'nguno wu'kenagu'zi wa V'aamoli, v'ikazi v'a henanha, wu'kaali' ku'gelani'la.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyu'v'a lyalokaga na giti kwingi'la, kasinaga lyafumi'i'laga ki'ti' lyavya lya lyonsi na ilambi' lya moto na ku'v'i'ta hagati' na viv'alango vya nyama zyeni'zyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwenu'lo, Gu'ku' Mulungu waki'ndi'kaga ilagano na Abulamu ku' ku'muwi'la, “Wu'v'yalwa wako nav'apaga nsi' yeni'yi', ku'fumi'i'la ha mongo gwa Misili mpaka ku' mongo muhanya gwa Efulate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nav'apaga nsi' ya V'akeni, V'akenizi, V'akadimoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'ahiti, V'apelizi, V'alefai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'aamoli, V'akanaani, V'agiligashi na V'ayebusi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
